 "brief": "The Palestinian Civil Defense said Gaza City governorate has only one rescue vehicle, which has been out of service for three weeks, Shehab Wire reported. The agency warned that crews lack the capacity to extract people trapped in rubble and appealed to organizations to provide tires and a pump.\n\nThe Civil Defense did not specify the cause of the vehicle's breakdown or provide a timeline for repairs.",
